sequenceDiagram
    title SD-07 - Financial Correction
    participant P0 as Accountant
    participant P1 as Correction UI
    participant P2 as Finance Service
    participant P3 as Finance Repository
    participant P4 as Database
    P0->>P1: Request correction with reason
    P1->>P2: proposeCorrection(request)
    P2->>P2: Verify authority and approval policy
    P2->>P3: loadOriginalAndAllocationState()
    P3->>P4: Read original transaction + allocations
    P4->>P3: Original state
    P2->>P2: Validate reversal impact and balances
    P2->>P3: beginTransaction(), recordAdjustment()
    P3->>P4: Append correction + effective allocation changes
    P4->>P3: Commit / rollback
    P3->>P2: Correction reference
    Note over P2: alt: accepted or rejected
    P1->>P0: Display correction history
